    "title": "2026 RBC Heritage Final Payouts, Prize Money, Winnings: Matt Fitzpatrick Wins $3.6 Million",
    "text": "No Masters hangover, or rest, for the weary. One week after another epic edition of the Masters, the PGA Tour picked right back up with its annual stop in Harbour Town. The RBC Heritage offered a $20 million purse, with $3.6 million to the winner.Matt Fitzpatrick is taking that big check, stuffing one close on the first playoff hole to defeat Scottie Scheffler in a playoff of former RBC Heritage champions. It was a redux of his 2023 win, when he hit one tight to defeat Jordan Spieth in a playoff. Fitzpatrick is now a four-time Tour winner and has won twice this season, having prevailed last month at the Valspar Championship.Here are the final payouts for the 2026 RBC Heritage.2026 RBC Heritage final payouts WIN: Matt Fitzpatrick, playoff: $3.6 million2. Scottie Scheffler, playoff runner-up: $2,160,0003. Si Woo Kim, 16 under: $1,360,000T4. Collin Morikawa, Harris English, Ludvig Aberg; 13 under: $823,333.217. Bud Cauley, 12 under: $665,000T8: Rickie Fowler, Kurt Kitayama, Patrick Cantlay, Gary Woodland; 11 under: $555,000T12. Keegan Bradley, Matt McCarty, Xander Schauffele, Steven Fisk; 10 under: $399,250T16. Jordan Smith, Maverick McNealy, Wyndham Clark, Akshay Bhatia, Sam Burns, Ryan Fox, Patrick Rodgers, Pierceson Coody, Andrew Novak; 9 under: $256,694.44T25. Michael Kim, Chris Gotterup, Sahith Theegala, J.J. Spaun, Russell Henley, Cameron Young, Aldrich Potgieter, Brian Harman; 8 under: $142,750T33. Michael Thorbjornsen, Ryan Gerard, Ben Griffin, Adam Schenk, Jordan Spieth, Karl Vilips, Jacob Bridgeman, Chandler Blanchet, Joe Highsmith; 7 under: $92,444.45T42. Jason Day, Sungjae Im, Daniel Berger, Andrew Putnam, Michael Brennan, Shane Lowry, Robert MacIntyre, Lucas Glover, Viktor Hovland, Sepp Straka; 6 under: $55,300T52. Garrick Higgo, Tommy Fleetwood, Sudarshan Yellamaraju; 5 under: $43,500T55. William Mouw, Nicolai Hojgaard, Corey Conners, Matt Wallace, Sami Valimaki; 4 under: $39,600T60. Ricky Castillo, J.T. Poston, Ryo Hisatsune, Nick Taylor, Mi